 "<div><h2>내 저장 백업</h2>\n<p class=\"bkp\">기기를 바꿀 때 쓰는 저장이에요. 모은 동물·도감·하트·알·꾸미기가 모두 들어가요. {0}</p>\n<div class=\"row\"><b>백업하기</b><div class=\"seg\"><button data-act=\"copy\">백업 코드 복사</button><button data-act=\"file\">파일로 저장</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><b>백업 불러오기</b><textarea id=\"bkText\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"여기에 백업 코드를 붙여 넣어요\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"seg\"><button data-act=\"paste\">코드 불러오기</button><button data-act=\"pick\">파일 고르기</button></div></div>\n<p class=\"bkmsg\" role=\"status\"{1}>{2}</p>\n{3}\n<div class=\"row\"><b>백업 알림</b><div class=\"seg\"><button data-nag=\"on\"{4}>켜기</button><button data-nag=\"off\"{5}>끄기</button></div></div>\n<input type=\"file\" id=\"bkFile\" accept=\".json,application/json,text/plain\" hidden>\n<button data-close>닫기</button></div>": "<div><h2>My save backup</h2>\n<p class=\"bkp\">Use this save when you switch devices. It holds your animals, collection, hearts, eggs and decorations. {0}</p>\n<div class=\"row\"><b>Back up</b><div class=\"seg\"><button data-act=\"copy\">Copy backup code</button><button data-act=\"file\">Save as file</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><b>Load a backup</b><textarea id=\"bkText\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Paste your backup code here\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"seg\"><button data-act=\"paste\">Load code</button><button data-act=\"pick\">Pick a file</button></div></div>\n<p class=\"bkmsg\" role=\"status\"{1}>{2}</p>\n{3}\n<div class=\"row\"><b>Backup reminders</b><div class=\"seg\"><button data-nag=\"on\"{4}>On</button><button data-nag=\"off\"{5}>Off</button></div></div>\n<input type=\"file\" id=\"bkFile\" accept=\".json,application/json,text/plain\" hidden>\n<button data-close>Close</button></div>",
