 "<div><h2>하늘 기록 <small>{0}/{1}</small></h2>\n<ul class=\"skrec\">{2}</ul>\n<p class=\"sub\">처음 본 하늘마다 ♥{3} · 밤이면 서식지 위로 떠요</p>\n<b class=\"vhd\">하늘 확률 (가안)</b><table class=\"skodds\"><tr><td>유성우</td><td>밤마다 {4} · 실제 극대일 밤엔 꼭</td></tr><tr><td>오로라</td><td>{5} · 설원 {6} · 그중 붉은 오로라 {7}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>혜성</td><td>{8}</td></tr><tr><td>쌍무지개</td><td>비 갠 낮 무지개의 {9}</td></tr><tr><td>보름달</td><td>실제 보름</td></tr><tr><td>별자리</td><td>맑은 밤 늘 · 계절마다 하나</td></tr>\n<tr><td>놓침 보장</td><td>유성우·오로라를 {10}일 못 보면 다음 밤엔 꼭</td></tr></table>\n<p class=\"note\">밤은 저녁 6시부터 새벽 5시까지예요 · 유성우·오로라는 서식지마다 따로 굴려요</p>\n<div class=\"nbtns\"><button class=\"go\" data-close>닫기</button></div></div>": "<div><h2>Sky log <small>{0}/{1}</small></h2>\n<ul class=\"skrec\">{2}</ul>\n<p class=\"sub\">♥{3} for each new sky · They appear over your habitat at night</p>\n<b class=\"vhd\">Sky odds (draft)</b><table class=\"skodds\"><tr><td>Meteor shower</td><td>{4} each night · Always on real peak nights</td></tr><tr><td>Aurora</td><td>{5} · Snowfield {6} · Red aurora among them {7}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Comet</td><td>{8}</td></tr><tr><td>Double rainbow</td><td>{9} of rainbows after daytime rain</td></tr><tr><td>Full moon</td><td>Real full moon</td></tr><tr><td>Constellation</td><td>Every clear night · One per season</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Missed-sky promise</td><td>Miss meteor showers and auroras for {10} days and the next night is a sure thing</td></tr></table>\n<p class=\"note\">Night runs from 6 p.m. to 5 a.m. · Meteor showers and auroras roll separately for each habitat</p>\n<div class=\"nbtns\"><button class=\"go\" data-close>Close</button></div></div>",
